Subject: [PATCH] Share native provider config identity with owned preloader

ConfigFile.Bind requires the same enum type when a key is bound again. Allow
the owned detour factory to retain the original provider enum identity so the
compatibility chainloader can still bind the same setting later.

diff --git a/Runtimes/Unity/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP/OpenACAIFriendAssemblies.cs b/Runtimes/Unity/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP/OpenACAIFriendAssemblies.cs
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Runtimes/Unity/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP/OpenACAIFriendAssemblies.cs
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+using System.Runtime.CompilerServices;
+
+[assembly: InternalsVisibleTo("OpenACAI.Endnight.Loader.Preloader")]
